  'duckvep_core', 'duckvep_reference_chunks', 'GRCh38'
));

# Ensembl regulation is prepared as its own SoA relation. RegulatoryFeature and
# MotifFeature rows retain distinct feature classes and source IDs; the named
# model loads only the five hot columns while metadata remains relational.
